All 15 tests pass. Fixed bugs:

**auth.py** — `has_permission`: case-insensitive comparison via `.lower()`. `is_admin_or_owner`: changed `and` → `or` so either admin role OR owner match grants access.

**inventory.py** — `__init__`: mutable `{}` default caused shared state across instances; fixed with `None` default and explicit dict copy. `add`: was overwriting stock instead of accumulating; fixed to `self._stock.get(sku, 0) + qty`. `reserve`: comparison was `>=` instead of `>` — should allow reserving exactly available stock. `release`: now raises `ValueError` when release would go negative.

**text_utils.py** — `slugify`: was not lowercasing input chars; added `.lower()` on the character. Multiple dashes (`---`) need recursive replacement; changed single `.replace("--", "-")` to a `while` loop. `truncate`: was doing `text[:max_len] + suffix`, making result `max_len + suffix_len`; fixed to `text[:max_len - len(suffix)] + suffix`.
